{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testimony is an episodic horror-thriller game anthology where each chapter tells a short story of people who have survived by making the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a testimony to tell, we\u2019ll love you to share it with us in our official channels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/04d238465f50cdfb6585b45ebfee9f01.poster.avif?t=1759874125\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/04d238465f50cdfb6585b45ebfee9f01.webm?t=1759874125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/04d238465f50cdfb6585b45ebfee9f01.mp4?t=1759874125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Testimony - Metal Graveyard</strong> <br>Mario, a college student in his early 20s, gets a call from a distant uncle asking him to take care of a junkyard in the middle of nowhere. As the days unfold, he\u2019ll wish he had never gone there. Mario survived by making the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/57a6ba9598372d6f8c56fda6e14a3d2f.poster.avif?t=1759874125\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/57a6ba9598372d6f8c56fda6e14a3d2f.webm?t=1759874125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/57a6ba9598372d6f8c56fda6e14a3d2f.mp4?t=1759874125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>Metal Graveyard is a first-person walking simulator atmospheric experience where you can drive, have conversations with NPCs and receive text messages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/9f5301fc1885fece95014b4b43f778b2.poster.avif?t=1759874125\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/9f5301fc1885fece95014b4b43f778b2.webm?t=1759874125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/9f5301fc1885fece95014b4b43f778b2.mp4?t=1759874125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school horror visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text messages from NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab and place objects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064000?t=1759874125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/ec93c0fc0d4ab630d8ec6336601cd49899866458/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759874125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/ddfd8db5674cc1fef0e42101ac639767ab7eb53e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759874125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/ddfd8db5674cc1fef0e42101ac639767ab7eb53e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759874125","categories":[{"description":"Sing